    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Dream-Thread Tuning.</strong> You learn to adjust the symbolic threads beneath events, granting small but meaningful shifts to perception, resolve, or timing.</p><p><strong>Once per Soma Break</strong>, you may spend 1 minute focusing and choose one of the following tunings. Each lasts 10 minutes.</p><ul><li><strong>Clarity Thread:</strong> You gain +1 Insight (Soul); allies within 2 squares gain +1 to either Investigation (Mind) or Perception (Mind) checks (your choice when selected).</li><li><strong>Courage Thread:</strong> You reroll the lowest die on defense checks against being Shaken; allies within 2 squares gain +1 to their next defense check.</li><li><strong>Foresight Thread:</strong> Once before the tuning ends, you or an ally may add +1d4 to an attack roll, save, or attribute check after seeing the roll but before knowing the result.</li></ul>",
      "chat": ""
    },
